| Nhu cầu | Nguồn |
|---------|-------|
| Pipeline đa model (Claude→Composer→Codex review; debug khi Human báo) | `multi-model-pipeline.mdc` · skill `game-dev-pipeline` |
| Ranh giới Agent vs Human | `agent-boundary.mdc` |
| Workflow tính năng | `docs-workflow.mdc` · `.cursor/docs/WORKFLOW.md` |
| Debug | `cocos-debugging.mdc` |
| `/checklist-done` | `checklist-done.mdc` · `.cursor/commands/checklist-done.md` |
